{
    desc => q{I inserts at first non-blank character},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/insert_I`

Tests that the **I** command enters insert mode with the cursor positioned
at the first non-blank character of the line (column 4 in this indented line).

**Keys:** `I`, type `hello `, `Escape`

**initial.png**
- Buffer contains "    indented line" (4 leading spaces)
- Cursor at column 0 (start of line)

**after_insert_at_first_nonblank.png**
- Line reads "    hello indented line" ("hello " inserted at column 4)
- Cursor on the space after "hello"
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->key('I');
        $ctx->type('hello ');
        $ctx->key('Escape');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_insert_at_first_nonblank');
    },
}
__DATA__
    indented line
